    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Desperate Measure</h2><p><em>When you are out of options, you become one.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>When you miss with an attack roll, you may choose to turn the miss into a glancing blow. The attack deals damage equal to your skill rank bonus (of the same type as the weapon or manifestation) and does not trigger additional effects.</p><p>Once you use this principle, you can’t use it again until you finish a short or Sanctuary.</p>",
